#AI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="**/*_test.go"

TEST_COMMAND:
- go test ./... -race
- go test ./... -coverprofile=coverage.out && go tool cover -func=coverage.out

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- Test files: foo_test.go in same package (white-box) or foo_test package (black-box)
- Test functions: TestFooDoesX(t *testing.T)
- Table-driven tests preferred for multiple input cases
- Subtests with t.Run for readability
- testify/assert for cleaner assertions (optional but common)

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "no hard threshold; -race flag required in CI")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real network calls — use httptest.Server
- No real filesystem writes — use t.TempDir()
- No t.Skip() without a comment and tracking issue
